      "en": "That same night, the word of God came to Nathan, saying,",
      "ko": "그 밤에 하나님의 말씀이 나단에게 임하여 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "48dbf77c7c403508dd169a3f89b367de231db5e55acae9c9085310dcfda9b905",
      "translation_text_hash": "47d9a4615709c3cc611b0003db23bb0467a7f828a8ec1b464f7c93deaf27c49b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 밤에 하나님의 말씀이 나단에게 임하여 가라사대"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "47d9a4615709c3cc611b0003db23bb0467a7f828a8ec1b464f7c93deaf27c49b"
      ]
    },
    {
