      "en": "This was a small thing in your eyes, O God, but you have spoken of your servant’s house for a great while to come, and have respected me according to the standard of a man of high degree, LORD God.",
      "ko": "하나님이여 주께서 이것을 오히려 작게 여기시고 또 종의 집에 대하여 먼 장래까지 말씀하셨사오니 여호와 하나님이여 나를 존귀한 자 같이 여기셨나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "a8e2fd472fbc86ae4751bbf0872b42ef156a8be8b9f12148daababa26fb83fb6",
      "translation_text_hash": "1456dc7da218fadcca0d9654dbea370311167d939ea5f22940bc0fcc1dfa455b",
