      "en": "LORD, there is no one like you, neither is there any God besides you, according to all that we have heard with our ears.",
      "ko": "여호와여 우리 귀로 들은 대로는 주와 같은이가 없고 주 외에는 참 신이 없나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "fea2b2945cf7d731cfc2d6c3c644bf7a58bee8608abe67fa709132d1930081e9",
      "translation_text_hash": "b9613460fa62e0cef137b9fd271cd9c2cad4f01c232bef31230ef2a424bff5c2",
