      "en": "Now, LORD, let the word that you have spoken concerning your servant, and concerning his house, be established forever, and do as you have spoken.",
      "ko": "여호와여 이제 주의 종과 그 집에 대하여 말씀하신 것을 영원히 견고케 하시며 말씀하신대로 행하사",
      "source_text_hash": "711c271deed35f70bca0d7b2b060ff0a234df9ff18b74e0580b3211255cce04f",
      "translation_text_hash": "2a2e9c30c56531cdf187e13aa90357163e75f70da50b7e96600787d2f9ed24d0",
